    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "James L. Murtagh Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market this two-bedroom mid-terrace residence at 7 Belvedere Terrace, Mullingar, Co. Westmeath, N91 F8D6.\r\n\r\nIdeally positioned within close proximity of Mullingar town centre, this property offers an excellent opportunity for those seeking a renovation project in a highly convenient location. The property has been vacant for over two years and may qualify for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant, subject to the relevant eligibility criteria and approval.\r\n\r\nExtending to approximately 1,031 sq. ft. (95 sq. m.) over two floors, the accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hallway leading to a living room, dining room and kitchen, together with a bathroom. There is also a separate room at ground floor level which was previously used as a bedroom.\r\n\r\nThe first floor provides two well-proportioned bedrooms, offering good potential to reconfigure and modernise the accommodation to suit individual requirements.\r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\nEntrance 1.08m x 5.08m\r\nLiving room 3.46m x 5.54m\r\nSitting room/ground floor bedroom 2.19m x 3.42m\r\nDining room 3.3m x 3.32m\r\nKitchen 1.83m x 4.06m\r\nBathroom 1.96m x 1.95m\r\nBedroom 1 3.11m x 4.84m\r\nBedroom 2 3.61m x 3.80m\r\n\r\nThe property also benefits from a generous rear garden, providing excellent outdoor space and offering potential to extend the existing residence, subject to the necessary planning permission and approvals.\r\n\r\nWhile the property requires refurbishment, its town-centre setting, generous floor area and potential eligibility for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant make this an appealing opportunity for homeowners, investors or those looking to undertake a project in Mullingar."
      },
